A||||14||GT Bastard||A strange dream I had....||||4||
Z||000000||GT Bastard||04-06-2000||08:52 AM||||<BR>I had a really strange dream last night.  I went to sleep at 3:15am and woke up at 6:30am, but I wasn't able to go back to sleep.  I was visiting this small town in the summertime, and it was really rainy outside the whole time.  I don't think I've ever seen it rain that hard before.  There was nothing but mud everywhere, and I was barely able to see anything through the thick sheet of rain.  I was just driving my truck around this dumpy little town when I spotted this auto repair shop.  There was some sort of tow truck that was backing up to this place and it was towing some sort of rusty import truck.  I'm not sure why, but I decided to pull into the lot and walk inside.  In the main office, the lights were very dim.  I saw the shop workers in the garage helping to push the truck inside. In the corner of this office, there was this large steel cage with a dark figure in it.  It really creeped me out.... I walk up to this cage and see that the inhabitant is some sort of an ape. I began to mock the ape a little.  I made all sorts of strange gestures and laughed at it.  All of a sudden this ape starts cussing at me!  That's about when I realized that this wasn't really an ape.  It was some sort of freak wearing an ape suit.  You wouldn't believe the things this guy was saying to me.  Really horrible stuff.  Anyhow, it really freaked me out so I decided to leave.  I think my girlfriend was in the car, because someone mentioned the word "camping" and it all made sense.  I was going camping in the woods.  All I can remember is driving into the woods(which happen to be about 50 yards from this auto repair shop.)  I make up the tent and fall asleep.  The next thing I remember is waking up in the morning and hearing somebody yell: "Have fun getting home you stupid mother f**ker!"  I ran outside of the tent and looked around.  I saw something in the trees and it was saying stuff like, "Have a nice day!"  I was thinking the ape had slashed my tires, but it didn't.  Instead it just let some air out of them.  I jumped in my truck and started to drive away, but this ape was chasing me.  My truck was moving extremely slow and I knew that ape would catch up.  Instead of continuing this way, I jumped out of my truck and confronted the ape.  The rest was a blur.  We were wrestling on the ground, and I was hitting him.  I don't think he was trying to hit me back, but I just kept beating him repeatedly.  The whole time that I was mangling him, he was laughing in this horrific tone.  Almost screaming.  I just felt like I was so filled with hate for him.  After he stopped moving, I pulled off the ape's head, and There was a mans face.  I don't think it was anyone I knew...  <BR>	I guess it could mean a lot of things... But I won't get into that.  Maybe it didn't mean anything at all.  It's just so very strange how the mind puts together elaborate stories in your head.  The last really wierd one I had was about a little black boy that lived in Wal-Mart, but I think I've rambled on enough for now....<P>later all||||reg||4
